      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I often used steamvr menu before vrchat fixed tracking while steamvr menu is open to disable my trackers as it would freeze them in single spot. That worked better than current mode as didnt rotate my body with my head werdly... So I really want this change, and being able to still move up/down with playspace mover would be even better",
