      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have not tested the latest IK beta build yet, but going by the patch notes it sounds like this has been completed there, and therefore can be marked as `Available in future release`. @{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name} \n\npatch notes:\n\n> - Trackers will now freeze relative to playspace rather than head direction\n\nEDIT: I have tested it now, its what I asked for ^^ (except I think controllers still go to their animated idle pose)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
